\u003eThe periodical \u0026#34;Razsvet\u0026#34; (Dawn) reported press releases from the intelligesta, correspondence between nations and ethnic groups, Jewish community events and holidays, advertisements that ranged from bottled water to shipping information, from hotels and sublets to delicatessen. Eventually, \u0026#34;Razsvet\u0026#34; reported information regarding the war effort, how the war was received (both on the front and at home), and how the war affected the Jewish community.\u003c/div\u003e\",\"dimensions\":\"9.8 x 12.6 inches\",\"downloadable\":\"Yes\",\"hideTranscript\":true,\"isArchivalFolder\":false,\"isPublished_eng\":true,\"isPublished_rus\":false,\"itemCode\":\"PER.00098\",\"itemCodeFull\":\"PER_00098\",\"itemFormat\":\"Books, Periodicals\",\"itemFormatId\":1005,\"itemId\":24496,\"itemType\":\"Periodical\",\"itemTypeId\":1041,\"landscapeImage\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__101078f06de6253f0179caf1bbb0f503bb1cb0500a2f88a6758ba1fcc79e4bf9/7279,214,5854,4391/max/0/default.jpg\",\"landscapeImage31\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__101078f06de6253f0179caf1bbb0f503bb1cb0500a2f88a6758ba1fcc79e4bf9/0,0,90,90/max/0/default.jpg\",\"landscapeImage32\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__101078f06de6253f0179caf1bbb0f503bb1cb0500a2f88a6758ba1fcc79e4bf9/0,292,13759,9172/max/0/default.jpg\",\"languages\":[],\"pageNo\":1,\"permalink\":\"http://n2t.net/ark:/86084/b4dr9q\",\"portraitImage\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__101078f06de6253f0179caf1bbb0f503bb1cb0500a2f88a6758ba1fcc79e4bf9/3219,0,7319.25,9759/max/0/default.jpg\",\"resourceUrl\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__101078f06de6253f0179caf1bbb0f503bb1cb0500a2f88a6758ba1fcc79e4bf9\",\"segmentsCount\":0,\"socialMediaThumbnail\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchive.org/iiif/3/baf__101078f06de6253f0179caf1bbb0f503bb1cb0500a2f88a6758ba1fcc79e4bf9/full/^!1000,1000/0/default.jpg\",\"squareImage\":\"https://iiiflb.blavatnikarchiv